@* asp-append-version fingerprints the URL. Without it these files are
   served with a stable URL and a warm browser cache keeps the
   pre-remediation copy — which would reinstate the suppressed focus
   outline (2.4.7) and the failing contrast values (1.4.3). The global
   AppendVersionTagHelperInitializer does not help here: LinkTagHelper
   only activates on links that already carry an asp- attribute. *@
